   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The logical link between successive paragraphs",
     "texto": [
      "In a B2.2 text, the transition from one paragraph to another must guide the reader about the direction of the thought:",
      "1. **Contrast with the previous thesis**: **Im Gegensatz dazu blieb die Entwicklung in den Städten stabil** (in contrast to this, development in the cities remained stable); **Demgegenüber steht jedoch der Einwand...** (by contrast, however, there is the objection...).",
      "2. **Thematic expansion**: **Darüber hinaus muss berücksichtigt werden, dass...** (moreover, it must be taken into account that...).",
      "3. **Conclusion or synthetic balance**: **Zusammenfassend lässt sich festhalten, dass...** (in summary, it can be noted that...)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Inter-paragraph transition function",
     "columnas": [
